					},
					"documentation" : "@dev given a token supply, reserve, CRR and a sell amount (in the main token), calculates the return for a given change (in the reserve token)\r\nFormula:\r\nReturn = _reserveBalance * (1 - (1 - _sellAmount / _supply) ^ (1 / (_reserveRatio / 100)))\r\n@param _supply             token total supply\r\n@param _reserveBalance     total reserve\r\n@param _reserveRatio       constant reserve ratio, 1-100\r\n@param _sellAmount         sell amount, in the token itself\r\n@return sale return amount\r",
